  "description": "I am Bariya, the greatest wildcat shifter in the world! (Age 10) One day, after losing my mother to hyenas and being hounded by them every single day—\n\n*“A kitten?”*\n\nI got caught by a fierce tiger shifter who couldn't even tell a wildcat and a cat apart! I was ready to scratch his face right off and make a run for it, until—\n\n*“You hate hyenas too? So do we. Let’s form an alliance.”*\n\nI figured I'd just stay under their protection since we shared a common enemy. Except…\n\n*“Little one, do you like shoulder rides?” “Eat up. Eat more! Keep eating until you’re so round you roll around!”\n\n“Play with me today!”*\n\nWhy on earth are these tigers being so sweet to me?!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
